		{
			dependencies: ["3AB573B5BD8866CF"]
			description: ["The &6Hyperstargate&r is the pack's last multiblock. It forms round a dial at Sgr A* orbit and opens a ring into the final dimension. The ring, the iris, the base, four power units and the interface, with a horizon lock kept in the controller. The dial. Nothing here is a production line. Build it once and keep the banks charged."]
			icon: "gtceu:hyperstargate"
			id: "1F0228D86B5ACECC"
