			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F0228D86B5ACECC"]
			description: ["The dial recipe opens the ring for 1,200 ticks. It eats the archive, the phase map, 16 phase locks and 64 jacketed cells. The &6Horizon Lock&r in the controller is kept. The full charge in the banks: 2^43 EU/t for the whole opening. The dial will not start on a charge it cannot finish. The crossing, and a spent charge to recharge. Stock every input and keep the banks full. The next opening costs the same."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_lock"
			id: "1E8E8FFC77B67321"
